ng this business better  than it can be for me it's always new  projects so as an example making these  videos was part of my CEO time for a  while it was a new experiment with  videos work would I enjoy it with the  fans enjoy would it help grow my  business I didn't know so I spent time  in the morning doing videos researching  the camera is testing out the different  gear seeing what would work  I put some videos up on YouTube and  people like them thank you and I like  the two I love answering the questions  it's part of my one of my favorite times  of the week is when i get to do my  videos for you guys and so i had to make  that part of my business so i took it  out of my CEO time and put it as part of  my wednesdays so now every wednesday I  come in I look at my questions I start  doing videos and then they have new CEO  projects so the idea behind the CEO  projects are new tasks that you're  trying to use to grow your business you  see if they work if they work you have  to decide if it's going to be you doing  it or ideal you can give it off to  somebody else to help you with for the  videos I think it has to be me on camera  my people are asking me a question I  like they respond personally but I don't  do all the video editing I have somebody  who that's his job he does all the video  editing for my videos so i can outsource  that part of it and then i work on new  CEO projects but the most important  thing is that you take dedicated time  you carve that out like the most  important meeting every day so that  there's always something new that's  growing in your business otherwise  you're not going to go out the treadmill  you're going to stay stuck where you are  you're not going to see any growth with  your company and you no wonder why are  you working so many hours so hard and  not seeing any growth if you want growth  you have to spend time on growth you  have to want it and you gotta dedicate  the time to it I hope that helps those  of you watching i